hey what is up everybody it's animak  here for anime uproar and we finally  have confirmation of the demon slayer  season 2 release date up until this  point we all knew that it would be  coming sometime in 2021 and while many  of us were speculating that it would  likely start airing in october of 2021  we didn't know for sure i mean it would  make sense since october is the start of  a new fall anime season but then again  if we look at last year attack on titan  started airing in december so you never  know however we now finally have the  information for demon slayer season 2  and i am so excited because season 2 is  going to cover what is probably my  favorite arc in the whole story so let's  get into it if you enjoyed the demon  slayer content on this channel and you  want us to keep it going just leave a  quick like and comment it only takes a  second but it helps with the youtube  algorithm and if you're new to anime pro  or maybe you watch our videos but you  haven't taken the time to subscribe yet  do me a quick favor and make this the  video that you subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications okay so the official  japanese demon slayer website recently  stated that demon slayer season 2 will  air on fuji tv in japan every sunday in  october of 2021 that's every sunday in  quotation marks both crunchyroll news  and the anime news network are also  reporting this and it has been reported  that demon slayer season 2 will feature  two coors meaning that it will have at  least 25 or 26 episodes and that it will  air during both the fall and winter  anime seasons this is amazing news  obviously since it means that we're  gonna get the same amount of episodes as  we had in season one and this means that  we won't get like a reduced 12 episode  or 13 episode half season many big anime  like attack on titan had these reduced  12 or 13 episode seasons in the past and  i know that some people were definitely  afraid that this could happen to demon  slayer as well thankfully that is not  gonna be the case we're gonna be getting  the full 25 or 26 episodes and they're  going to be airing in the fall of 2021  and winter of 2022. now the big question  is this we know that demons player  season 2 is going to be airing on  sundays in october but which exact  sunday in october will the first episode  air the very first sunday in october is  october 3rd right at the beginning of  the month so it is fair to assume that  demon slayer season 2 could also begin  airing as soon as october 3rd which is  only about 3 weeks after the making of  this video that's actually crazy that's  really soon and i definitely hope that  this is the case since i can't wait for  this season to begin as i said earlier  it is covering one of my absolute  favorite arcs in the whole story the red  light district arc also known as the  entertainment district arc and i will  talk more about the ark in a second but  first i do want to mention that while it  definitely makes sense for demon slayer  to start airing on the very first sunday  of october since the news websites are  reporting that it will air every sunday  in october and that of course includes  the first sunday october 3rd it is still  possible that the season might begin  airing on a different sunday in october  obviously i wanted to start right away  on the 3rd but we can't exclude the  possibility that it might start like a  week later on the 10th so while i am  hopeful that we're gonna get it started  as soon as possible i do want to give  everyone a heads up that the anime  production schedules in japan can be  weird and unpredictable at times now on  top of this massive release date news we  also have some other interesting news  relating to the demon slayer anime the  anime news network is reporting that  fuji tv the tv station that is going to  be airing season 2 in october is also  going to be airing five special  compilations of demonstrators season 1  in september these compilations will  serve as a recap of season 1 for  everyone who wants to refresh their  memories before heading into season 2.  but interestingly enough these  compilations are said to feature new  footage that wasn't originally included  with the first season that is actually  really interesting and i'm curious to  see what new footage they're talking  about will this be manga content that  the anime didn't include or will it be  stuff that wasn't even in the manga  these five specials or recap  compilations will air on september 11th  12th 18th 19th and the 23rd and if we  get something interesting in that  special extra footage i will of course  let you guys know right here on the  channel so don't forget to subscribe and  click the bell so you don't miss any  latest demon slayer updates now let's  talk about season 2 itself and the first  arc that it is going to cover the red  light district arc also known as the  entertainment district arc if you've  heard the arc called the red light  district and entertainment district and  you're confused don't worry this is the  same arc i think that the words red  light district have certain connotations  that some publications would prefer to  avoid and that is why they refer to it  as the entertainment district arc  this arc takes place four months after  the events of the mugen train arc our  boys tanjiro zenitsu and inosuke have  been training hard to get stronger and  they've also been going on demon slayer  missions to gain experience  following some sudden and strange events  that nearly led to aoi being kidnapped  tanjiro zenitsu and inosuke are  recruited for an important mission by  tengen uzui a former ninja and current  sound hashira uzui is a flashy and  flamboyant gigachad and one of my  favorite characters in the entire story  he informs tanjiro and the gang that  they are going to be heading into the  flashiest place in all of japan a place  full of lost and avarice the red light  district apparently this district has  been plagued by demon activity and a lot  of people have gone missing there  recently these disappearances are likely  the result of demon attacks but whoever  these demons are they've been extremely  effective in avoiding detection now  remember when i said that uzui was a  gigachad i really wasn't joking this man  is such a chad that he actually has not  one but three hot ninja wives and these  three wives infiltrated the red light  district in order to gather intel and  locate the elusive demon who has been  hiding there however their secret  communications with uzui suddenly  stopped that is why uzui needs backup  and our heroes tanjiro inosuke and  zenitsu disguise themselves as girls in  order to infiltrate three establishments  within the red light district  establishments which have been  identified by uzui as the most likely  hiding places of the demon or demons  this incredibly unique situation leads  to tons of both comedy and drama and the  entire arc is just a masterpiece in my  opinion the main villain of this arc is  also absolutely exceptional it is  somewhat powerful devious and absolutely  full of surprises i can't wait to see  this entire arc animated and if you've  been enjoying the demon slayer anime so  far trust me when i say that it is only  going to get better from here let me  know down in the comments if you're  excited for season 2 of demon slayer and  what is your personal favorite arc in  the story if you only seen the anime  then you can just pick one from the  anime movie and if you read the manga  then you can also include the manga arcs  i look forward to hearing from you down  in the comments if you enjoyed this  demon slayer video and you want us to  keep it going definitely leave a like it  only takes a second but it helps a lot  and if you don't want to miss any future  demon slayer videos or important updates  definitely don't forget to subscribe and  hit that notification bell to turn on  all notifications you have to make sure  that you subscribe hit the bell and then  also select that option that says all if  you don't do that you're still going to  miss a ton of our videos even if you are  subscribed it's just how youtube works  you can also hit me up on twitter and  instagram at animeopror i want to give a  quick thank you to all of our anime  uproar patrons who make videos like this  one possible special thank you to alpha  sigma he is an absolute mad lad and  disciple of lord twego himself and i  can't forget all of our the one tier  patrons the ones who rise above all  other clans including ingrata pate heffa  algital hinokamien water the toasted chi  the spike dylan isidore spidey life  chanel tungsten tarcus big buddhist and  monkey d quilly finally thank you to all  of our pro hero tier patrons including  the one and only gilgamesh the red  haired raven angel crews rathune de ora  very gucci alicia octor bonnie parks  joanne garcia ted no ted fatboy games  corey mcgowan and soul ray slice and  dice if you enjoy our videos and you  feel that they provide value to you  consider supporting us on patreon even a  single dollar will give you access to  our patreon exclusive discord and your  name will appear in our videos along  with these legendary people as always  thank you guys so much for watching and  until next time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

